==Icelandic==

===Etymology===
From {{inh|is|non|eða}}, from {{inh|is|gem-pro|*efþau}} and thus related to {{cog|goh|odar}}, {{cog|ang|oþþe}}, {{cog|got|𐌰𐌹𐌸𐌸𐌰𐌿}}.

